error[L0605]: `newer` returns a `car`, which cannot hold the borrow in `other`
  --> emit/untied_implementor_borrows.rslisp:10:13
   |
10 |   (newer (c other) (if (> (:year c) (:year other)) c other))
   |             ^^^^^ this borrow reaches the result
   |
   = note: a trait signature cannot name the lifetime that `car` holds
   = help: write `self` in place of `car` for this parameter in the trait

error[L0605]: `relabel` returns a `car`, which cannot hold the borrow in `label`
  --> emit/untied_implementor_borrows.rslisp:11:13
   |
11 |   (relabel (label c) (->car label (:year c)))
   |             ^^^^^ this borrow reaches the result
   |
   = note: a trait signature cannot name the lifetime that `car` holds
   = help: build the `car` in a function outside the trait

error[L0605]: `badge` returns a borrow that cannot come from `c`
  --> emit/untied_implementor_borrows.rslisp:12:16
   |
12 |   (badge (year c) (if (> year (:year c)) "old" (:model c)))
   |                ^ the result borrows from this value
   |
   = note: no parameter of the trait's signature holds a borrow, so the result takes the `'static` lifetime
   = help: take this parameter as `(ref self)` in the trait, so the result can borrow from it

error[L0605]: `model-of` returns a borrow that cannot come from `c`
